    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Rebellion Era Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Rebellion Era Campaign Guide</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Species_Feats\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Species Feats\">Species Feats</a></i></p><p>You know how to survive on both the night and day sides of your homeworld, allowing you and your allies to weather the harsh environments of the galaxy.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Twi%27lek\" title=\"Twi'lek\">Twi'lek</a></p><p><b>Effect:</b>&nbsp;Once per hour when you and your allies are in an environment of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Extreme_Heat\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Extreme Heat\">Extreme Heat</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Extreme_Cold\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Extreme Cold\">Extreme Cold</a>, you can make a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Survival\" title=\"Survival\">Survival</a> check. You and up to 10 allies can use the results of the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Survival\" title=\"Survival\">Survival</a> check in place of your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Fortitude_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fortitude Defense\">Fortitude Defense</a> when the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Extreme_Heat\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Extreme Heat\">Extreme Heat</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Extreme_Cold\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Extreme Cold\">Extreme Cold</a> makes its hourly attack roll against your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Fortitude_Defenses\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fortitude Defenses\">Fortitude Defenses</a>.</p>",
